WEBVTT

16:30.349 --> 16:32.601
Tough old beast.

16:34.895 --> 16:36.981
There are no direwolves
south of the Wall.

16:37.856 --> 16:39.149
Now there are five.

16:40.776 --> 16:42.444
You want to hold it?

16:43.946 --> 16:46.073
(PUP WHIMPERS)

16:46.991 --> 16:48.492
BRAN: Where will they go?

16:48.617 --> 16:50.327
Their mother's dead.

16:50.452 --> 16:51.996
They don't belong down here.

16:52.121 --> 16:55.916
Better a quick death.
They won't last without their mother.

16:56.041 --> 16:58.043
- Right. Give it here.
- No!

16:58.168 --> 16:59.837
- (WHIMPERS)
- Put away your blade.

16:59.962 --> 17:02.881
- I take orders from your father, not you.
- Please, Father!
